WEBVTT

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:43.060
Hey, stay back, stay back!  We don't know what's going to happen.

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:45.640
Whatever!  We're true Tokyoites!

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:48.500
These towers ain't gonna stop us from going about our business!

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:01.070
Hey, you guys, it's dangerous here.

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:10.600
Y-You bastards!

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.890
You two wait here.

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:49.850
Don't let anyone come up here.

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:52.350
Kill any intruders if you want to.

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:53.330
Yes, sir.

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:17.580
Shit!  Where did she go?  She vanished.

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:19.970
There she is!

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:48.540
There's nowhere else to go now.  Give it up.

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:07.880
Chiko!

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.430
You don't have to run by yourself.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:11.180
Ken-niichan!

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:16.040
An airship?

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:17.610
Could that be Twenty Faces?

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:20.150
Capture the girl!  It's all over if she escapes!

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:55.390
It's her.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:56.590
She's up there!

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:01.980
Young lady?

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.290
Ah-ah-ah-ah...

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:05.640
She's good!  I knew it.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:06.950
Let's follow her!

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:20.130
Hold it right there!

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:21.990
It's dangerous here.

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:23.380
Go and find shelter!

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.200
Shut up and move!

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:26.440
We're following that airship...

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:30.470
Next time I won't stop at a threat.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:31.970
Now go and take shelter immediately!

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:34.210
That explosion wasn't the last!

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:38.280
Th-That's right.  Twenty Faces was going to steal Tokyo.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:40.520
Tokyo will be burnt to rubble again.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:47.280
Do not run.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:50.490
Go and find shelter like the policeman said.

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:13.560
You're not hurt, are you?

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.560
Remember, I told you.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.900
You're well-known so you'd better be careful.

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:22.960
Over there.

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:25.690
Please take the ship to that tower.

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:27.800
Twenty Faces is there.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.430
I have to go to him.

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:35.080
The boss?

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:37.840
The professor is probably there as well.

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:51.940
Are you sure?

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:55.920
Twenty Faces did ask you to keep her safe.

00:06:56.880 --> 00:07:00.480
If I don't do it, Chiko might just jump off.

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:10.860
We don't know when the next explosion will be.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:13.750
Please mobilize the entire Tokyo police force

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:16.900
and evacuate the people as far away as possible.

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:18.910
I understand.

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:21.270
As for me, I'm going after that airship.

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:25.250
She holds the key after all.

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:35.480
It's another new type of bomb!

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:36.840
It's war!

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:38.740
The war's started again!

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:42.770
It's Twenty Faces!  He came to destroy Tokyo!

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:44.770
Mister...

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:10.480
Shit!

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:11.420
Chiko, you OK?

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:23.610
Damn it!

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:02.300
I'm taking her down.  Hang on tight!

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:03.350
Will we be all right?

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:05.080
Don't worry.

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:07.100
We were crashing like this last time, too.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:28.060
Well?  Landed her nicely, didn't I?

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:29.530
Yes indeed.

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:31.500
Though it looks like we'll be walking home.

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:37.530
So we meet again.

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:41.010
I'm getting sick of looking at your faces!

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:13.570
That's far enough, Professor.

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:15.670
Damn you.

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:19.050
Let's end this.

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:36.690
You did that to your own body?

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:40.100
Damn it, are they invulnerable?

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:41.440
They're not invulnerable.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:50.410
Are we really going to be able to beat them like that?

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:53.320
If we can do it before they notice, we have a chance.

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:55.470
A chance, huh?

00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:57.940
If we can survive that long!

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:05.750
It looks like that wound you got underground is bothering you.

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.620
Your movement lacks spirit.

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:15.590
It bothers me that you won't let me enjoy this any longer.

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:20.400
I've waited a long time for this day to come.

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:25.390
My old flesh and bones can be reborn through the power of science.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:30.390
She left me such wonderful experimental results.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:57.270
I would have never had such wonderful results without all that funding from the military.

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:58.550
See it with your own eyes.

00:12:58.550 --> 00:13:00.640
Your hypothesis was correct.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:04.890
By helping them kill people,

00:13:04.890 --> 00:13:07.190
in just a few years,

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:10.970
we were able to complete decades worth of research!

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:14.190
In order to seize the future,

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:16.480
you need to become a demon.

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:39.420
Why?

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:43.300
Why did you quit halfway through?

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:50.320
If you're quitting, then I'll finish it myself.

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:54.310
In a body fit for a demon.

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:19.790
You're...

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:20.670
...not Twenty Faces.

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:24.320
Mister!

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:27.320
Chiko...

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:30.550
That man never had it in him.

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:40.770
He was never qualified to handle the great legacy I left to him.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:43.350
Why does he look like you?

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:45.020
It's because of hate.

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:47.730
I hate that man.

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:51.780
I entrusted everything to his unrivaled genius.

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:58.330
He's the man who led us down a path of evil and then took everything away.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:05.300
Since then, I took it upon myself to procure the funds needed to complete the experiments.

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:18.700
My hands are completely covered in blood.

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:21.440
There was no other way.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:31.420
And this is what the world began to call me:

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:33.970
Mystery Man Twenty Faces.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:40.960
However, around the same time, that man began doing the same things as me.

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:48.050
He was a showy phantom thief who gave advanced warnings and then made off with his objectives.

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:57.850
And before I knew it, Twenty Faces had become his moniker.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:11.820
He was a thief in name only, just a wolf in sheep's clothing.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.530
We allowed the pigs to grow fat during the war.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:16.280
I was just working to reverse that.

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:19.790
So you're seeking atonement?

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:25.170
Just as you destroyed the super-weapons we designed?

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:29.460
He can't get the war out of his mind after all.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:33.990
No matter where I went, you were always there.

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:37.530
As if you were ridiculing me from afar.

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:39.230
Then it dawned on me.

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:42.640
We're two sides of the same coin.

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:45.980
Once I kill you, my other self,

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:48.630
I'll finally be fully complete.

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:51.130
And now I've won.

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:54.820
The future belongs to me.

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:57.400
I'm your other self?

00:16:57.400 --> 00:16:59.030
What a horrible joke.

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:03.070
The "other self" I'm looking for

00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:06.590
is someone who will reveal a new panorama.

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:11.730
The mistake I made was to focus solely on the future and lose sight of the people around me.

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:14.140
I was unable to see through your madness.

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:17.590
You damn loser!

00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:19.840
Mister!

00:17:21.590 --> 00:17:24.300
Now you can see it for yourself,

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:26.960
that my experiments are complete.

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:32.430
You took on his form to make a new life for yourself while hating him the whole time?

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:39.090
You're nobody now.

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:42.080
I will be the one to stop you.

00:17:43.550 --> 00:17:45.370
I dare you to try.

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:57.360
It's futile.

00:17:57.360 --> 00:18:00.120
What can a little girl like you do to me?

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:02.480
I'm the Daughter of Twenty Faces...

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:05.120
No, I'm his daughter!

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:23.850
I told you it was futile!

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:25.640
Chiko!

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:40.110
You saw all those stupid people, didn't you?

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:43.460
Denying that they were the ones who caused the war

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:46.800
and living their lives like nothing happened.

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:49.240
We should destroy them all.

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:56.830
It's time for the people to learn that everything's already lost.

00:18:56.830 --> 00:19:00.320
Time to decide what this world needs.

00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:02.870
The future...

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:03.950
...is in my hands!

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:29.520
What?!

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:38.090
It's the tower.

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:39.030
Ah-ah-ah!

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:42.530
Oh no!

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:32.080
That's the light from before.

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:32.960
Let's get out of here!

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.990
It's magnificent.  Everlasting light!

00:20:57.990 --> 00:20:59.660
I won!

00:20:59.660 --> 00:21:02.310
I'm creating the future!
